===Etymology===
From {{inh|bg|cu|чрънъ}}, from {{inh|bg|sla-pro|*čьrnъ}}, from {{inh|bg|ine-pro|*kr̥snós||black}}. Cognates include Serbo-Croatian {{m|sh|црн}}, {{m|sh|crn}}, Slovene {{m|sl|črn}}, Slovak {{m|sk|čierny}}; Norwegian and Swedish {{m|sv|harr||grayling}}, Sanskrit {{m|sa|कृष्ण|tr=kṛṣṇá}}, Old Prussian {{m|prg|kirsnan||black}}.

